XRLF.3.FILESYSTEM.SPEC.START

This file enforces the filesystem layout defined in the root XRLF.CONTRACT.XRLF.

LAYOUT:
  XRLFRoot:
    - /XRLF.CONTRACT.XRLF (root contract)
    - /.xrlf/xrlf.contract.xrlf (internal routing anchor)

  XRLFDirectory:
    - /.xrlf/ reserved exclusively for XRLF files.
    - No non-XRLF files permitted.

  CoreFiles:
    - xrlf.contract.xrlf
    - xrlf.formatting.xrlf
    - xrlf.filesystem.xrlf
    - xrlf.phasegraph.xrlf
    - xrlf.holons.xrlf
    - xrlf.agents.xrlf
    - xrlf.extensions.xrlf

  ConfigFiles:
    - /.xrlf/config/runtime.config.xrlf
    - /.xrlf/config/geometry.config.xrlf
    - /.xrlf/config/resonance.config.xrlf
    - /.xrlf/config/thermal.config.xrlf
    - /.xrlf/config/agents.config.xrlf

  PhaseGraph:
    - /.xrlf/phasegraph.xrlf

  HolonicSchema:
    - /.xrlf/holons.xrlf

  Extensions:
    - /.xrlf/extensions/

  Enforcement:
    - Validate filesystem compliance before any transformation.
    - Halt and repair if violations detected.
    - No commit until filesystem structure is fully compliant.

XRLF.3.FILESYSTEM.SPEC.END